Armas: {
	ResonanciaEcos: La resonancia despierta {0} eco(s).
	GuardianDetenido: El grimorio detiene al guardián en seco: «A ti solo te devoraré UNA vez… con eso me basta.» (+1 nivel)
	OjoFortalecido: El escuadrón está lleno: el grimorio FORTALECE a un ojo (+{0}% de daño).
	EscuadronFortalecido: THE WHOLE SQUAD GROWS STRONGER! ({0} eyes · +50% damage each)
	EscuadronMejora1: THE SQUAD GROWS STRONGER! ({0} eyes gain THE GOLDEN RING of the black hole: +50% damage each)
	EscuadronMejora2: THE SQUAD GROWS STRONGER! ({0} eyes gain THE VIOLET RING of the abyss: +50% damage each)
	EscuadronMejora3: THE SQUAD GROWS STRONGER! ({0} eyes gain THE GOLDEN SUN of the upgrades: +50% damage each)
	EscuadronMejora4: THE SQUAD GROWS STRONGER! ({0} eyes gain THE BLUE-STAR SUN, the last ring: +50% damage each)
	DagaInvocada1: ✧ THE CRYSTAL DAGGER joins the squad! — rapid slash flurries (50% damage, +20 armor penetration)
	DagaInvocada2: ✧ THE FLAME DAGGER joins the squad! — wide arcing sweeps through the enemy field
	DagaInvocada3: ✧ THE ROCK DAGGER joins the squad! — lunges with recoil (300% damage)
	DagaInvocada4: ✧ THE DAGGER OF THE VOID joins the squad! — impales its prey and drips the void
	DagaInvocada5: ✧ THE DAGGER OF THE VERDICT joins the squad! — marks its prey and passes sentence (150%)
	DagasLlenas: ✧ The five daggers of the Eternal live: further summons empower the eyes again (+50% damage per empowerment)
	CetroEscuadron: ✧ THE SCEPTER RAISES THE FULL SQUADRON! ({0} eyes · {1} daggers — all at once)
	CetroCompleto: ✧ The squadron is already complete: 11 eyes and 5 daggers live — the scepter refreshes their icons.
	OjosAlMaximo: Los once ojos ya llevan sus cuatro mejoras: no queda nada que fortalecer.
}

