ElOjoQueMira: {
	DisplayName: THE EYE THAT WATCHES
	Tooltip:
		'''
		"Everything turns on its eye: the grimoire’s window."
		THE EYE APPEARS near the enemy under your cursor, charges its
		gaze and FIRES: the beam pierces everything it crosses.
		EVERYTHING struck receives THE SILENT MARK — and the mark ignites
		THE VOID BURN (1% of max life per half second, 5 s).
		IN MULTIPLAYER: the marked enemy player BURNS too.
		Grows with the Eternal Grimoire’s level: +1.5% damage and
		−0.5% mana per level.
		'''
}

